    "size": 20957063,
    "mandatory": false,
    "changelog": "OPXdemon 1.7\n- Universal APK: the app now installs on every Android device — arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a (32-bit ARM), x86 and x86_64.\n- All native components (terminal + protected JNI) are compiled for all four ABIs.\n- On non-arm64 devices Rootless setup is hidden; the rooted (chroot) engine picks the rootfs matching the device ABI.\n- versionCode 9, versionName 1.7."
  },
  "news": [
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "OPXdemon 1.7 — universal APK for every phone",
      "description": "OPXdemon 1.7 (versionCode 9): the APK now installs on every Android device. Native libraries are compiled for arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a (32-bit ARM), x86 and x86_64, so 32-bit and Intel devices can install and run the app too. Rootless mode stays arm64-only (it needs an arm64 QEMU VM); rooted chroot mode works on any ABI.",
      "newsDate": "2026-08-12",
      "newsUrl": "https://github.com/mahmudabegum8859-design/strykerapp",
      "imageUrl": "",
      "pinned": true,
