    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "OPXdemon 1.5 \u2014 QEMU boot fix (code 159) + USB Wi-Fi enumeration + multi-arch libslirp",
      "description": "OPXdemon 1.5 (versionCode 6): fixes the \"QEMU exited during boot (code 159)\" crash with a bionic-linked QEMU 11.0.2 rebuild (the musl build hit a sandbox-blocked syscall). USB Wi-Fi adapters now enumerate at the right speed (USBDEVFS_GET_SPEED fix), and armhf / i386 / amd64 guests now download libslirp.so like arm64. Payload refresh also repairs stale or partial installs automatically before boot.",
      "newsDate": "2026-08-12",
      "newsUrl": "https://github.com/mahmudabegum8859-design/strykerapp",
      "imageUrl": "",
