    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "OPXdemon 1.4 \u2014 auto payload update + USB Wi-Fi in the VM",
      "description": "OPXdemon 1.4 (versionCode 4): the rootless engine now auto-refreshes its payloads from the core-files release (kernel / initrd / QEMU / rootfs) when they change, so the new USB Wi-Fi rootfs reaches every device automatically. All architectures ship 160+ wireless drivers + firmware (rtl8xxxu incl. RTL8188FTV, rt2800usb, mt76x0u/x2u, ath9k_htc, zd1211rw) \u2014 USB adapters work in the guest with monitor mode + injection.",
